<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 879 0 R
/E (The Internet of Things is already changing the way people live and interact with humans and machines. Businesses in every vertical have already started to leverage the power of IoT platforms to increase their efficiency and performance. This course introduces the students to the three layer architecture of the IoT exploring all the major connectivity options and application layer protocols. It also encourages the students to develop interesting applications using different development boards, sensors and actuators. The course introduces the students to cloud platforms and analytics including security aspects of IoT Application development. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [43]
>>
