/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 944 0 R
/E (This course introduces learners to the world of embedded systems using MicroPython, a lightweight implementation of Python 3 designed to run on microcontrollers. Students will develop a strong foundation in embedded programming principles using accessible and readable Python code. The course guides students from basic setup and scripting to more advanced interfacing with sensors, hardware protocols, and simple Internet of Things \(IoT\) applications. Through practical labs, real-world examples, and mini-projects, learners will gain hands-on experience in building responsive and connected embedded systems. )
/Pg 109 0 R
/K [50]
>>
endobj
