/E (Understand and apply the fundamentals of MicroPython programming for embedded systems, including setting up environments and writing code for basic I/O operations. Interface microcontrollers with sensors, actuators, and displays using digital, analog, and communication protocols such as I2C, SPI, and UART. Develop and deploy IoT-enabled embedded applications using networking features in MicroPython \(Wi-Fi, HTTP, MQTT\) for real-time monitoring and control. Design and implement a complete embedded system project, demonstrating integration of hardware and software with proper documentation and presentation. )
